# The monorepo's root .gitignore already covers the first two; they are
# repeated so the folder stays correct once split into its own repository
# (docs/guides/separate-repo.md).
node_modules
dist
# Per-item registry files from `npx shadcn build`, regenerated from registry.json.
public/r
# The monorepo's root .gitignore ignores every folder named assets/ (for the
# hero footage master). Component assets are source: re-include them, or a
# clean checkout cannot build Mascot and registry.json --check fails.
!src/components/*/assets/
